Track 1: Black-Stamen Strangles the Locomotive
- Story & Context: In the shuddering cargo vestibule of the northern express out of Kem, Maren jammed her thumb against an overheating micro-synth while Ilya's contraband frost-orchids violently threw their pods across the rusted brake gear. The sharp odor of burnt electrical insulation and damp potting soil choked the car just as the engineer yanked the emergency brake, throwing the insomniac commuters to the iron floor. Refusing to cut the performance, Maren dropped her contra-bassoon to a bone-splintering sub-A through three daisy-chained fuzz boxes, howling the hook over the screeching steel: "Crush the seed between the iron ties."
